BDL entry: 8 bytes — dword0 = buffer physical addr, dword1 = [bit31 IOC][bit30 BUP][15:0 sample count (16-bit samples, i.e. count = bytes/2)]. Samples = r9/2.

NABM PCM out (base 0x10): BDBAR at +0x10 (dword), LVI at +0x15 (byte), CR at +0x1B (byte). CR: bit0=RPBM run, bit1=reset.

